---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../lib/site';

const listings = await getCollection('listings');
---
<BaseLayout title="About this site and who runs it" description={`Who runs ${SITE_NAME}, why it exists, how it is paid for, and what it has and has not done.`}>
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</p>
    <h1>Who runs this site, and why it exists</h1>
    <p class="lead">Most pages that rank construction bidding software are written by vendors. This one records what each vendor's own pages say about price, who pays and which plan unlocks bidding.</p>

    <h2>Who runs it</h2>
    <p>{SITE_NAME} is operated by PALM ICON LLC in Miami, Florida. It is an independent site. No listed vendor owns it, pays to be listed, or reviews what we write about them before it is published.</p>
    {CONTACT_EMAIL && <p>You can reach us at <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>}

    <h2>What we did</h2>
    <p>In October 2026 we read the public pages of {listings.length} vendors and recorded what each says about price, plans, who pays and who the product is built for. Every listing links to the pages we read and shows the date we last checked them.</p>

    <h2>What we did not do</h2>
    <p>We did not request quotes, call vendors or use their products. We have not hands-on tested any listing, and nothing here is a recommendation to buy one. The table lists what vendors state, with third-party figures labeled as such, and leaves the judgment to you. The <a href="/how-we-compare/">how we compare</a> page explains the price labels.</p>

    <h2>How the site is paid for</h2>
    <p>Some links are affiliate links, marked as sponsored in the page code and disclosed on the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> page. Whether a vendor has a program does not decide whether it is listed, where it appears or what we say about it. Tools are listed in alphabetical order within each group.</p>

    <h2>Who it is for</h2>
    <p>General contractors, subcontractors and small trade businesses comparing bid management, takeoff, estimating and quoting software before they ask for a demo.</p>

    <h2>If we got something wrong</h2>
    <p>Prices and plans change often. Tell us and we will check it against the vendor's page and fix it.{CONTACT_EMAIL && <> Write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</>}</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
